Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(克鲁克路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(克鲁克路  气球)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fire that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a damn mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能借我一用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow that a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会漏过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not leaving you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车厢后面有抹布\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some rags in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -我之前没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见你做过同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen you do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:57.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:01:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm the...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界上最幸运的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}luckiest guy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你帮我推开汽车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you help me with one of these cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路还长着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some miles to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我这件超级舒适又好看的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have something to say about my extremely comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and attractive shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  它看起来很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没扣好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you missed a...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我们有豆奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we had some soy milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喝过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever tried it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我三年级时的最好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best friend in third grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对牛奶过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was allergic to dairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他每天午餐时都会带上豆奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every day he would bring this soy stuff to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我喝过  -然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I tried it. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我吐了  -别说瞎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I threw up. - Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  我差点吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. I almost threw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was like, ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶心死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  我宁愿喝奶粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, literally, I would rather have powdered milk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不愿意再喝那种东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to have to drink that stuff again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿喝朱迪思的婴儿奶粉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather have Judith's formula--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去把书看完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go finish my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还剩几章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a couple chapters left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到他在里面笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard him laughing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都快忘了他的笑声是什么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost forgot what that sounded like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能同时当他的严父和益友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be his father and his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你一下子很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that's a lot to throw at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果你需要休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're ever feeling like you need a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done taking breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是暂时的避风港\N{\fnArial\fs30}or just a stop along the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.59,0:05:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先在这里住下再商量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just stay here while we figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多的补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll need more supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟卡尔去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with Carl and get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昨天还昏迷不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were unconscious yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-今天醒了  -我们需要你恢复体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm awake today. - We need you strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再休息一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会去多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you think you'll be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装满几个袋子  应该不会太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill a couple bags, shouldn't be too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是八点一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 8:15 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们中午回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back by noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  你听她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you follow her lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几小时后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到好东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漫画书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comic books?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.59,0:08:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳酪布丁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy Cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  乳酪布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bam, Crazy Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是密封的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it still sealed and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做个好人  让你吃第一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'll be nice and let you have the first pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来不像没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太擅长逗你这个年龄的男孩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not very good at making boys your age laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心里笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小宝宝觉得我很逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toddlers find me funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两三岁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, three-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小宝宝是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean toddlers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有过一个三岁的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a three-year-old son
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他觉得我超级搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he happened to find me extremely funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要食物  电池  水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need food, batteries, water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分清主次\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你从没告诉过我你有过孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you ever tell me you had a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有其他孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have any others?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你结过婚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you married?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.18,0:10:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每次只回答一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll answer one question at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:37.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每进一个房间回答一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}one room at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且必须在我们确认屋内安全之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only after we've cleared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要  对不起  -你是个撒谎的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm sorry. - You're a lying coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  求你了  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么做  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈对我说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell'd you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我说别这么做  -这不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said don't do this. - This ain't your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我很抱歉  伙计  -你闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, man. -Aw, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉  不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能和好的  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work this out. Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别这么做  -我不会停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do this. - It's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不要  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你会搞定他吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You plan on finishing the job? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我耳朵都要聋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting an earache
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道他会让他惨叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know he's just gonna let his ass squeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭他做过的事  这男的活该流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what he did, the man deserves to bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想的话就都留在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all stay down there if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今晚就住这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be our abode for the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的烂摊子收拾干净  哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean up your mess, Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your son's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了检查后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said after.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这其实是两间分开的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, these are actually two separate rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们已经检查了那间  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we already cleared that one, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:13:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andre.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫安德烈·安东尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Andre Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去看看那儿有没有藏着饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure there isn't a box of cookies hiding in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有其他孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have any other kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友  注意游戏规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rules of the game, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  你真适合当间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you could be a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个孩子对我而言就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One was enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德烈就是个小麻烦  像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Andre was a handful, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个走廊算一个房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this hallway count as a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你能在这里找到物资就算\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can find something we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只找到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only thing I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it count?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理论上算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:28.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那事发生在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened after--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生在灾变之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, after everything happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does my dad know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没告诉过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在刚刚告诉你之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never told anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没告诉过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}till just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会为你保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your secret is safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也不算什么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not really a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是会保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(别打扰  梅梅在睡觉)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(梅梅)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:12.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a baby in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸让我给她取名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad let me name her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:20:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她跟安德烈在同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe her and Andre are together somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.14,0:20:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快中午了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是晚了  你爸爸会担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad will wonder where we are if we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comfy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我弄醒就为了问我舒不舒服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waking me up to see if I'm comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想躺会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这层还有两个卧室呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two other bedrooms up here to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是小孩的床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them's kids' beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要这张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-已经被我占了  -我可不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's claimed. - I didn't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你换个地方去占吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna have to lay claim somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伦  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伦  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, Len!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.11,0:21:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-住手  -休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,床归我了  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bed now, jackoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.87,0:22:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.55,0:22:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一离开监狱我们就跟行尸干上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were fighting biters and you passed out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:22:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你晕倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}right after we left the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.45,0:23:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐在卡车后面似乎比走路更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The back of the truck seemed safer than the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路上有大巴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we pass a bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有没有路过一辆大巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the road, did we pass a bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.93,0:23:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.65,0:23:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们路过多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long since we passed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.33,0:23:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  快停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, numbnuts, stop the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.29,0:23:53.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.05,0:24:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.68,0:24:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你的女伙伴有没有告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what your lady friend's told you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这次任务的特殊性\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the special nature of the mission we're on,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.71,0:24:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this shit is time-sensitive
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.21,0:24:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且已经比计划晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're already way behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你马上转身给我回车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need you to turn your ass around and get back in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.35,0:24:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我必须得走  -你们俩好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta go. - It seems like neither one of you's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.45,0:24:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}been paying close enough attention
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在的糟糕处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the hell on earth we've been living in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.61,0:24:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就告诉你怎么才能避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me tell you how to best avoid
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成那种行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}winding up just another dead-alive prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到强大而且志同道合的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find some strong, like-minded comrades
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.59,0:24:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后不论发生什么  都待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stay stuck together like wet on water.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.14,0:24:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多多益善  我们相互依赖  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more the better. We need each other, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.30,0:24:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便有这么多装备  你也不可能撑过一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with all that gear on your shoulder, you won't last a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己肯定不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.46,0:24:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to insist
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.46,0:24:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you hold the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.84,0:25:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全人类的命运也许就取决于此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fate of the entire damn human race might depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.95,0:25:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.11,0:25:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.66,0:25:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是亚伯拉罕·福特中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sergeant Abraham Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.70,0:25:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are my companions
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.23,0:25:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔·埃斯皮诺萨和尤金·伯特博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita Espinosa and Dr. Eugene Porter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的任务是把尤金送到华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a mission to get Eugene to Washington, DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金是科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene's a scientist
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.64,0:25:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道行尸遍地的真正原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he knows exactly what caused this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.17,0:25:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.67,0:25:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.78,0:25:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一直在用卫星电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd been talking to the muckety-mucks in Washington
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.47,0:25:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和华盛顿高层保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his satellite phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但过去的几个星期里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past couple weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.67,0:25:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人接电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody's been picking up on the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们看到了你之前是如何对付行尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw how you handled those corpses back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.17,0:26:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.17,0:26:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前我们不得不离开那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get us off that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.24,0:26:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晕过去了  我们也没有子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were passed out, we were out of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.80,0:26:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我知道怎么回到大巴那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know how to get back to that bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.08,0:26:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把每个转弯都记下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote down every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你带回去的  我可以的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will get you back, I can, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会去那找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where she'd go to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.10,0:26:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我要去那  -那是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's where I'm gonna go. - It's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉告诉了我发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara told us what went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.95,0:26:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到你妻子的可能性为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is zero chance you will ever find your wife again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.64,0:26:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.70,0:26:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  抱歉这样说 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Mainly because, sorry to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.45,0:26:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.57,0:26:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要也去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need for you to die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.99,0:26:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.03,0:27:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回车上去  做点有意义的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in the truck. Do something with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.04,0:27:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the people we...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.49,0:27:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱的人死...\N{\fnArial\fs30}we love kick...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他们消失时\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, they disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.52,0:27:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不意味着你也要跟着消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean you've got to go out that way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还活着  我会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive and I'm gonna find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.83,0:27:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.05,0:27:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嘿  -亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, hey! - Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.82,0:27:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get off him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.26,0:27:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.00,0:27:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want this, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.70,0:27:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.37,0:28:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-亚伯拉罕  -住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abraham! - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.69,0:28:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-住手  -亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.01,0:28:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.53,0:28:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打了  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.35,0:28:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.87,0:28:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪  该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop firing, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪了  我们得去拿武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop firing! We need to get our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.68,0:28:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:28:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我支枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我支枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.92,0:29:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.33,0:30:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼  伦  滚下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, Len, get your asses down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.40,0:30:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.79,0:31:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claim, Claim, Claim!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.33,0:31:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上臭嘴  我要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the hell up. I'm trying to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.72,0:31:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个女的住在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woman shacking up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.56,0:31:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -你下来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say what? - Come on down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.27,0:32:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-漂亮吗  -现在先别撸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She hot? - Don't grab your pecker just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.36,0:32:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们瞎嚷嚷什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you hollering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.13,0:32:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了她的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found her shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是今天早上才洗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have washed it this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.32,0:32:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好香啊  -你们找到了衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smells good. - Oh, you found a shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.97,0:32:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她搞不好已经离开很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be miles away by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.94,0:32:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就没必要费力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she go to all the trouble of washing a shirt
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.05,0:32:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗一件要扔的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she's just gonna ditch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她会回来的  -她回来之后  我要第一个上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She'll be back. - I call first when she gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.90,0:32:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道她有没有同伴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows who else she got with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做好万全准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-伦  你去侧面房间  -等一下  我去拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Len, take the side room. - Hold on, let me get a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.73,0:32:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会盯着前厅  你负责另一侧的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch the front den, you've got the other side room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我以为托尼负责呢  -托尼跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought Tony got that. - Where the hell is Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.45,0:32:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.95,0:32:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他叫起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.68,0:35:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当时开着卡车执行护送任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were running a convoy in one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.25,0:35:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开上一个沙丘  有个骆驼站在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up a dune, there's this camel,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.11,0:35:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像是要吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}looks like it's about to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是因为哪个混蛋给它屁股上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because shitbird's packed
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.88,0:35:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驼了大概1.8公斤的C-4炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}about four pounds of C-4 up its ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.96,0:36:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们距离爆炸点也就六米左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were within 20 feet of that blast
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.54,0:36:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驼峰炸飞出去了半公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sent that animal's hump half a klick into the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.83,0:36:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们还能开车回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we drove home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.77,0:36:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你跟我说说你到底做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you tell me how in the holy hell
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.80,0:36:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能让这卡车抛锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you possibly kill this truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.72,0:36:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高度兴奋的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fully amped-up state
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.81,0:36:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和对速射武器的无知\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an ignorance of rapid-firing weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.29,0:36:25.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.24,0:36:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车子坏了我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.31,0:36:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们能到达华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you guys make it to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.07,0:36:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.27,0:36:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们他妈的还能干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell else are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.86,0:37:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去华府啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.63,0:37:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拯救世界啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix the whole damn world!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.18,0:37:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那条路安全  北边就难说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way's clear. Who knows what's north.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.93,0:37:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先跟着他们  找到车再离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another vehicle. We'll go with them until we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.02,0:37:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我比你聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. I'm smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.86,0:38:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.27,0:39:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-挡住它  -奶奶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop her! - Son of bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.31,0:39:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了它  杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her! Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.30,0:39:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.44,0:39:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to hand it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.32,0:39:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子真坚决\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a persistent son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.04,0:39:42.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你为什么跟随他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get why you're following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.26,0:39:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.97,0:39:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.97,0:39:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.72,0:39:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what we're doing--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.88,0:39:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how else to say it--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.82,0:40:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving the world is just--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.53,0:40:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更为重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.97,0:40:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算他找到妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even if he does find his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.61,0:40:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不把尤金送到华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think they'll live happily ever after
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.91,0:40:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他们能安稳生活多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we don't get Eugene up to Washington?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.52,0:40:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我跟着格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think because I'm following Glenn,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.16,0:40:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说明我是个好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes me a good person?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.15,0:40:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.34,0:40:26.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.32,0:40:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.81,0:40:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如我也不了解你为什么要去华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I don't know anything about why you're going to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.64,0:40:35.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道尤金为什么去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get why Eugene's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.41,0:40:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是唯一一个知道如何终结这一切的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one that knows how to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.06,0:40:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而罗西塔是因为爱你  她会永远伴你左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rosita, she loves you. She'd follow you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.92,0:40:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你为什么同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why the hell you agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.26,0:40:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他穿越大半个国家...\N{\fnArial\fs30}to drive him halfway across the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.03,0:40:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想拯救世界就这么难相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that hard to believe, I want to save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅仅因为你是个好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a good person?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.41,0:40:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用告诉我真正原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.64,0:40:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也别骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.40,0:41:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳酪布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy Cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.78,0:41:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.64,0:41:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.75,0:41:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.92,0:42:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(避难所和社区  欢迎所有人  抵达就能活命)
